  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space with this sport-themed bedding set by Jeminise, designed for football lovers, players, and fans. Featuring a cool digital illustration of an American football player with a burning ball, this comforter set adds a dynamic, athletic vibe to any bedroom. Whether you are looking for a lightweight duvet cover or an all-in-one cozy comforter, this customizable set is the perfect sporty addition to your home decor or a thoughtful gift for holidays and birthdays.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize your bedding with custom text inputs such as a name and number for a unique, one-of-a-kind sports gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Bedding Options:</strong> Choose between a lightweight duvet cover with a hidden zipper closure (no filling included) or a cozy, all-in-one comforter with a soft microfiber filling.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric, offering a soft, lightweight, durable, and comfortable sleep experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Accessories:</strong> Complete your football-themed bedroom setup by adding matching optional pillowcases or an additional flat sheet cover.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Craftsmanship:</strong> Made using advanced environmental protection dyeing techniques that hold color to prevent fading, finished with fine, compact stitching along the edges.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care Instructions:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; tumble dry on low heat or air dry to keep the microfiber soft and fluffy.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Cool Footballer Hold the Ball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
